WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.019
People will say, "I'm not
flexible enough to do yoga.

00:00:04.019 --> 00:00:06.060
I'm too old to do yoga.

00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:08.620
I'm not healthy
enough to do yoga."

00:00:08.620 --> 00:00:11.378
But really, if you have a
body and you can breathe,

00:00:11.378 --> 00:00:12.045
you can do yoga.

00:00:14.830 --> 00:00:17.470
And just by
regulating the breath,

00:00:17.470 --> 00:00:20.260
someone can have a
profound experience of yoga

00:00:20.260 --> 00:00:23.790
in their very first class.

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:28.710
But that 15 minutes you
spent nourishing yourself

00:00:28.710 --> 00:00:31.080
means that when you
go back to your family

00:00:31.080 --> 00:00:33.990
or you go back into
your work situation,

00:00:33.990 --> 00:00:35.355
you have something to offer.

00:00:39.010 --> 00:00:41.410
In this MasterClass
you're getting

00:00:41.410 --> 00:00:44.230
something basic
yet very essential

00:00:44.230 --> 00:00:48.780
to your understanding
of what yoga is.

00:00:48.780 --> 00:00:52.800
I'll be demonstrating
the simplest practices

00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:56.490
to more advanced versions
of those practices.

00:00:59.640 --> 00:01:02.550
This is a really
wonderful way of breathing

00:01:02.550 --> 00:01:06.240
if you're anxious, if you're
feeling emotional tension.

00:01:06.240 --> 00:01:10.040
Purse the lips,
making a sound "who."

00:01:10.040 --> 00:01:13.250
You may want to add
imagery that you

00:01:13.250 --> 00:01:14.960
have a candle in front of you.

00:01:14.960 --> 00:01:18.260
You're making it
so gentle, so soft,

00:01:18.260 --> 00:01:20.710
that the candle doesn't
flicker or go out.

00:01:24.430 --> 00:01:29.170
Life as we know it can
change in an instant.

00:01:29.170 --> 00:01:33.220
Three years ago, I had
a serious accident.

00:01:33.220 --> 00:01:37.480
I've been using yoga
to restore my body.

00:01:37.480 --> 00:01:41.740
First two years was mostly about
learning how to walk again.

00:01:41.740 --> 00:01:46.850
I'm witnessing quite a
miraculous restoration.

00:01:46.850 --> 00:01:50.540
We may move through some
real storms in our life.

00:01:50.540 --> 00:01:56.210
Thank goodness I've had yoga to
find some part of myself that

00:01:56.210 --> 00:02:00.440
is unshakable, pristine,
could never be damaged.

00:02:00.440 --> 00:02:02.870
That's really the
focus of the practice--

00:02:02.870 --> 00:02:08.419
to find the part of ourselves
that is always steady.

00:02:08.419 --> 00:02:13.630
I'm Donna Farhi, and
this is my MasterClass.

